          <change when="2022-02-08T04:08:55-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/ngonis">Submit - Entered text from the edition but with corrections (discussed with WGC): lin6 doesn't have αστοῦ (an odd division) but Ἀντωνίνου, with everything after τ written in Verschleifung; this helps restore the common formula in the lacunas. In lin7 we have Μηδικ(οῦ) with κ raised rather than Μηδι(κο)ῦ) (or even Μηδικοῦ, with everything after Μηδι verschliffen). </change>
